---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="AI Exploration"
  description="Not sure what AI could do for you? We come to your building and show you, offline."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AI Exploration</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Not sure what AI could do for you? We come to your building and show you, offline.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <p><strong>Based in Lampeter, Wales. We visit within 60 road miles, and up to 120 miles by arrangement.</strong></p>
      <p><em>Conversations can be booked now; visits from February 2027.</em></p>
      
      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">It starts with a free 45-minute conversation.</h2>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="steps-list">
        <li><strong>A conversation first.</strong> Free, 45 minutes, by phone or in person. You tell us how your work runs and what you want to know about AI. Then you decide whether to book a visit.</li>
        <li><strong>We come to you.</strong> Half a day in your building. We sit down with you and the people who do the work, and look at how it actually runs.</li>
        <li><strong>Offline.</strong> Any machine we bring is fully offline, sealed from the internet and from your network.</li>
        <li><strong>Your plan.</strong> What AI could take on in your work, and what to keep human, written down for you.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">What you get</h2>
      <p>A short written plan, one or two pages, on paper or a fresh USB stick. It says what AI could take on in your work, what to keep human, and why.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">What we specialise in</h2>
      <ul class="capabilities-list">
        <li>Fitting AI to how your work actually runs: your tasks, your tools, your people.</li>
        <li>Small organisations and sole traders: practical steps you can take straight away.</li>
        <li>Knewing what to keep human: the tasks, data and decisions where people matter most.</li>
        <li>A short written plan in plain English that you keep.</li>
        <li>Your information stays yours. What you show us is used only for your plan.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">What it costs</h2>
      <p>Published prices.</p>

      <div class="pricing-table">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Visit</th>
              <th>Price</th>
              <th>What it covers</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Free first conversation — 45 minutes</td>
              <td>Free</td>
              <td>You tell us what you need; you decide whether to book</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>AI Exploration — half a day</td>
              <td>£750 + VAT</td>
              <td>At most 4 hours on site, and a short written plan</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p class="pricing-note">On-site within 60 road miles of Lampeter; travel included. Up to 120 miles, £150 + VAT a visit.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">Terms of a visit</h2>
      <ul class="terms-list">
        <li><strong>Notice:</strong> 10 working days for a first visit, so anyone who looks after your IT can sign off; we send a one-page device statement.</li>
        <li><strong>You provide:</strong> a private room with a table, one UK power socket, and someone from your team to be present at the start and the finish.</li>
        <li><strong>AI Exploration:</strong> at most 4 hours on site; a short written plan of one or two pages.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> free to move or cancel up to 5 working days before. Later than that, or if there is no room or no one from your team on the day, the fee carries to one new date within 60 days. If we cancel, you choose a full refund or a new date.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment:</strong> private firms pay on booking; public bodies by purchase order, invoiced on the day at 30 days.</li>
        <li><strong>Travel:</strong> on-site within 60 road miles of Lampeter; travel included. Up to 120 miles, £150 + VAT a visit.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="cta-banner" style="margin-top: 48px;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Book a conversation</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0;">It starts with a free 45-minute conversation. Tell us where you are, what your work involves, and a few dates that suit you.</p>
        <a href="mailto:info@cogniosynthesisportal.uk?subject=AI%20Exploration%20conversation" class="btn btn-primary">Email to book</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f3f0 0%, #ebe7e4 100%);
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0dcd8;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    color: #0e1020;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #4b4d5d;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .steps-list, .capabilities-list, .terms-list {
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  .steps-list li, .capabilities-list li, .terms-list li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #4b4d5d;
    line-height: 28px;
  }

  .pricing-table table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .pricing-table th,
  .pricing-table td {
    padding: 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dcdce0;
  }

  .pricing-table th {
    background: #f6f3f0;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0e1020;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #4b4d5d;
  }

  .cta-banner {
    background: #f6f3f0;
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-banner h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #0e1020;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .cta-banner p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #4b4d5d;
    line-height: 28px;
  }
</style>
